go-600/15 rounded-full blur-[128px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n      <div class=\"w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-violet-600/10 rounded-full blur-[96px] pointer-events-none -translate-y-20 translate-x-32\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\">\n      <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-950/60 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-8\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"zap\" class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\"></i>\n        <span>Nexus Agentic Core v3.0 Released</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-tight\">\n        Build, Deploy & Scale <br>\n        <span class=\"bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 via-violet-300 to-cyan-300\">Autonomous AI Agents</span>\n      </h1>\n\n      <p class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed\">\n        Empower your enterprise with intelligent multi-agent swarms that execute complex business workflows, analyze datasets, and write code automatically.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\">\n        <a href=\"#demo\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-violet-600 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-violet-500 text-white shadow-xl shadow-indigo-600/25 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition hover:scale-105 active:scale-95\">\n          Start Free Sandbox\n          <i data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"#features\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"play-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n          Watch 2-min Walkthrough\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Trust Badges -->\n      <div class=\"mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-slate-900\">\n        <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 font-semibold mb-6\">Trusted by engineering teams at</p>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8 sm:gap-16 opacity-60 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all\">\n          <span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-400\">ACME CORP</span>\n          <span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-400\">PULSE.IO</span>\n          <span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-400\">SYNTHEX</span>\n          <span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-400\">VORTEX AI</span>\n          <span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-400\">CLOUDSCALE</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Features Grid -->\n  <section id=\"features\" class=\"py-24 bg-slate-900/50 border-t border-slate-900\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n      <div class=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">Engineered for Velocity</h2>\n        <h3 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">Everything you need to orchestrate agent fleets</h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n        <!-- Card 1 -->\n        <div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition group\">\n          <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950 border border-indigo-800/50 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-6 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white transition\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"cpu\" class=\"w-6 h-6\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3\">Multi-Agent Swarms</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Coordinate distributed agents with dynamic roles, hierarchical delegation, and shared memory vector stores.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Card 2 -->\n        <div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition group\">\n          <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950 border border-indigo-800/50 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-6 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white transition\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"shield-check\" class=\"w-6 h-6\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3\">Sandboxed Execution</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Enterprise-grade isolation runs arbitrary code and tool actions safely with granular privilege scopes.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Card 3 -->\n        <div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition group\">\n          <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950 border border-indigo-800/50 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 mb-6 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white transition\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"gauge\" class=\"w-6 h-6\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3\">Zero-Latency Observability</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Trace every LLM decision, token consumption spike, and tool invocation with sub-millisecond precision.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Interactive Demo Preview Section -->\n  <section id=\"demo\" class=\"py-24\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n      <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-950 border border-slate-800 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n        <div class=\"px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-900/80\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>\n            <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>\n            <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>\n            <span class=\"ml-3 text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono\">agent-orchestrator.ts</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-indigo-950 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-800/50\">LIVE KERNEL</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 sm:p-10 font-mono text-sm space-y-4\">\n          <div class=\"text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">➜</span>\n            <span>Initializing cluster swarm: 4 workers dispatched</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-slate-300 pl-4 border-l-2 border-indigo-500/50\">\n            <p><span class=\"text-indigo-400\">[Agent-Research]</span> Scraped 14 market analyses</p>\n            <p><span class=\"text-cyan-400\">[Agent-Analyst]</span> Synthesized competitive vector database</p>\n            <p><span class=\"text-violet-400\">[Agent-Writer]</span> Drafted 8 customer lifecycle campaigns</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-2 pt-2\">\n            <i data-lucide=\"check-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n            <span>All tasks completed in 1.42s (0.003$ compute cost)</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Pricing -->\n  <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-24 bg-slate-900/30 border-t border-slate-900\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n      <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">Transparent Pricing</h2>\n        <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">Scale seamlessly from prototype to enterprise</h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n        <!-- Starter -->\n        <div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">Developer</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6\">For indie hackers and hobbyists.</p>\n            <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-8\">\n              <span class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-white\">$0</span>\n              <span class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">/month</span>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8\">\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> Up to 3 active agents</li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> 10,000 runs / month</li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> Community Discord</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-medium transition\">Get Started</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Pro (Featured) -->\n        <div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-950/60 to-slate-900 border-2 border-indigo-500 flex flex-col justify-between relative shadow-xl shadow-indigo-500/10\">\n          <div class=\"absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n            Most Popular\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">Team Pro</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6\">For high-growth startups and labs.</p>\n            <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-8\">\n              <span class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-white\">$49</span>\n              <span class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">/month</span>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8\">\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> Unlimited agent swarms</li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> 500,000 runs / month</li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> Dedicated vector sandbox</li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> Priority 24/7 SLA</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold transition shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30\">Start 14-Day Trial</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Enterprise -->\n        <div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\">Enterprise</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6\">Dedicated deployment & SOC2.</p>\n            <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1 mb-8\">\n              <span class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-white\">Custom</span>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8\">\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> Self-hosted VPC deployment</li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> Custom fine-tuned models</li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><i data-lucide=\"check\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400\"></i> Dedicated customer engineer</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-medium transition\">Contact Sales</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- FAQ Accordion -->\n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-24\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">Got Questions?</h2>\n        <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"space-y-4\" id=\"faq-list\">\n        <div class=\"faq-item border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/50\">\n          <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full px-6 py-4 text-left flex justify-between items-center text-white font-medium\">\n            <span>How does NexusAI ensure agent execution safety?</span>\n            <i data-lucide=\"chevron-down\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-400\">\n            Every agent runs inside ephemeral, micro-isolated WebAssembly and containerized runtimes with zero access to your internal network unless explicitly configured via authenticated MCP tools.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"faq-item border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/50\">\n          <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full px-6 py-4 text-left flex justify-between items-center text-white font-medium\">\n            <span>Can I integrate custom LLM providers?</span>\n            <i data-lucide=\"chevron-down\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-400\">\n            Yes! NexusAI natively supports Gemini 2.5 Flash, Claude 3.5 Sonnet, GPT-4o, and local models via Ollama and vLLM with plug-and-play API keys.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"faq-item border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900/50\">\n          <button class=\"faq-toggle w-full px-6 py-4 text-left flex justify-between items-center text-white font-medium\">\n            <span>What happens after the 14-day free trial?</span>\n            <i data-lucide=\"chevron-down\" class=\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200\"></i>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-sm text-slate-400\">\n            You can either continue on the Developer free tier without interruption or subscribe to Team Pro with your saved agents and workflows intact.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"border-t border-slate-900 bg-slate-950 py-12 text-slate-500 text-sm\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n          <i data-lucide=\"sparkles\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"text-white font-bold tracking-tight\">NexusAI Inc.</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>&copy; 2026 NexusAI. Built with modern web standards.</p>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-300\">Privacy</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-300\">Terms</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-slate-300\">Security</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- Scripts -->\n  <script>\n    // Initialize Lucide Icons\n    lucide.createIcons();\n\n    // Mobile Menu Toggle\n    const mobileBtn = document.getElementById('mobile-menu-btn');\n    const mobileMenu = document.getElementById('mobile-menu');\n    if (mobileBtn && mobileMenu) {\n      mobileBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        mobileMenu.classList.toggle('hidden');\n      });\n    }\n\n    // FAQ Accordions\n    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle').forEach(button => {\n      button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const content = button.nextElementSibling;\n        const icon = button.querySelector('i');\n        const isHidden = content.classList.contains('hidden');\n        \n        // Close all\n        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-content').forEach(c => c.classList.add('hidden'));\n        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-toggle i').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('rotate-180'));\n\n        if (isHidden) {\n          content.classList.remove('hidden');\n          if (icon) icon.classList.add('rotate-180');\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
